Z||000012||FieroHarry||12-10-2001||12:19 AM||||Wow,<BR>Thanks for all the good words <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>I would have replied sooner but had the duty this weekend.<P>Total drop from the new springs was very hard for me to tell (i had cut my factory ones down before just to make it ride better at 250k) but I will guess 2" total.<BR>These Eibachs have had me in fre4akin heaven for a week now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I never imagined my car could ride so nice.<P>AS to the rear sway bar well the Fiero Store ****ed me on my order and didnt send the hardware ubtil after 2 e-mails and 3 phone calls and one supposed delivery (us mail) I finally got the parts.<BR>Tomorrow night or the next it will be on the car and that will be the final suspension change for me for a long time.<BR>Ive replaced the following items in the last 3 months<BR>Upper and lower balls<BR>all tie rods and rack<BR>Shocks/struts (again)<BR>new sway bar endlinks up front<BR>front bearings<P>Hell since I got her 4 years ago I have logged over 130K miles so she needed this badly<P>Im hoping to have my engine swap done by the end of Jan (3.4) and the turbo im stealing from a Supra will go with it some time next summer.<BR>Really all I have left to due now (before ill say im finished) is the rear deck lid scoop/quarter windows/Mr Mikes leathers/paint job.<BR>Then the girl will see way less milage cuz shes gonna see "toy" status in the garage.<P>PS Dragon, Ill see you and the wife in Daytona this spring!<BR><P>------------------<BR><BR><B>"If you want to blend in, take the bus!"</B>||||reg||14
Z||000013||Smoooooth GT||12-10-2001||10:27 AM||||Looking great.. I can really see a difference!!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/vroom_5.gif">        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooooothgtsig_9.gif">                <BR>      <P> <A HREF="http://www.thefibersmith.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefibersmith.com</A> <P>Technical  Support (903) 825-7744 Steve<BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||1
